  "cues": [
    {
      "start": 0.3,
      "end": 3.3,
      "text": "How do you build something you have never built before?"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.82,
      "end": 6.78,
      "text": "What if mixed reality could teach you a physical skill"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.78,
      "end": 8.88,
      "text": "through direct guidance and feedback?"
    },
    {
      "start": 10,
      "end": 12.04,
      "text": "A manual can show the next step,"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.28,
      "end": 14.739999999999998,
      "text": "but it cannot see what happened on the table."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.04,
      "end": 17.62,
      "text": "It cannot tell whether a part is misplaced,"
    },
    {
      "start": 17.78,
      "end": 20.799999999999997,
      "text": "explain what went wrong, or guide the correction."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.8,
      "end": 25.5,
      "text": "AssemblyPilot connects a physical workspace with mixed reality."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.84,
      "end": 28.380000000000003,
      "text": "On HoloLens, you confirm an assembly field"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.380000000000003,
      "end": 31.36,
      "text": "on the table and see the next step as a hologram."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.730000000000004,
      "end": 37.550000000000004,
      "text": "You place the real brick and select Check Step."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.79,
      "end": 39.47,
      "text": "The camera captures that moment,"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.47,
      "end": 42.330000000000005,
      "text": "and the feedback appears directly in your workspace."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.1,
      "end": 52.660000000000004,
      "text": "The same web application also runs in a regular browser."
    },
    {
      "start": 53,
      "end": 56.18,
      "text": "This makes the system easy to test with your own parts,"
    },
    {
      "start": 56.34,
      "end": 58.86,
      "text": "even when immersive hardware is not available."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.6,
      "end": 64.28,
      "text": "Here, the blue brick is in the right place,"
    },
    {
      "start": 64.44,
      "end": 66.78,
      "text": "but the wrong printed side faces forward."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.42,
      "end": 70.50000000000001,
      "text": "AssemblyPilot explains the issue and proposes a fix:"
    },
    {
      "start": 70.98,
      "end": 71.9,
      "text": "rotate the block."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.44,
      "end": 75.88000000000001,
      "text": "The user corrects the real build and selects Check Again."
    },
    {
      "start": 76.34,
      "end": 78.58000000000001,
      "text": "Only then is a new image taken,"
    },
    {
      "start": 78.64,
      "end": 81.54,
      "text": "and the next decision is based on that fresh evidence."
    },
    {
      "start": 81.98,
      "end": 83.92000000000002,
      "text": "This time, the step is verified."
    },
    {
      "start": 86.07,
      "end": 87.98999999999998,
      "text": "When the visual evidence is unclear,"
    },
    {
      "start": 87.98999999999998,
      "end": 90.72999999999999,
      "text": "AssemblyPilot does not pretend to know."
    },
    {
      "start": 91.14999999999998,
      "end": 93.77000000000001,
      "text": "An uncertain result is not a pass."
    },
    {
      "start": 94.09,
      "end": 95.37,
      "text": "The workflow pauses."
    },
    {
      "start": 95.76999999999998,
      "end": 97.07,
      "text": "The user changes the view"
    },
    {
      "start": 97.07,
      "end": 100.19,
      "text": "or corrects the assembly, and selects Check Again."
    },
    {
      "start": 101.2,
      "end": 104.64000000000001,
      "text": "The browser or HoloLens camera captures the real scene."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.08,
      "end": 106.9,
      "text": "The backend validates the request"
    },
    {
      "start": 107.14,
      "end": 109.68,
      "text": "and the Assembly Orchestrator manages the workflow."
    },
    {
      "start": 110.2,
      "end": 112.82000000000001,
      "text": "Muse Spark evaluates the assembly state."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.02000000000001,
      "end": 116.62,
      "text": "When enabled, SAM 3.1 adds object localization"
    },
    {
      "start": 116.62,
      "end": 118.02000000000001,
      "text": "and segmentation."
    },
    {
      "start": 118.38,
      "end": 120.9,
      "text": "The validated result returns to both the browser"
    },
    {
      "start": 120.9,
      "end": 122.76,
      "text": "and the mixed-reality display."
    },
    {
      "start": 135.8,
      "end": 138.8,
      "text": "Today, AssemblyPilot guides a LEGO assembly."
    },
    {
      "start": 139.32000000000002,
      "end": 142.44000000000003,
      "text": "Tomorrow, the same interaction could support cooking,"
    },
    {
      "start": 142.76000000000002,
      "end": 145.86,
      "text": "repairs, education, and industrial training."
    },
    {
      "start": 146.32000000000002,
      "end": 148.54000000000002,
      "text": "Imagine putting on mixed reality and learning"
    },
    {
      "start": 148.54000000000002,
      "end": 150.88000000000002,
      "text": "to cook without prior experience,"
    },
    {
      "start": 151.04000000000002,
      "end": 153.82000000000002,
      "text": "with guidance adapted to what is happening in front of you."
    },
    {
      "start": 154.8,
      "end": 158.8,
      "text": "AssemblyPilot turns instructions into an interactive learning loop:"
    },
    {
      "start": 158.8,
      "end": 162.20000000000002,
      "text": "from guidance, to action, to visual verification."
    },
    {
      "start": 162.20000000000002,
      "end": 165.86,
      "text": "AI-guided mixed reality for the real world."
    }
  ]
}
